      <title type="text">Order By和In处的SQL注入该怎么防？</title>
      <published>2026-06-23T16:19:37.000Z</published>
      <updated>2026-06-23T16:19:37.000Z</updated>
      <author><name>林不到</name></author>
      <link rel="alternate" href="https://linbudao.github.io/posts/order-by%E5%92%8Cin%E5%A4%84%E7%9A%84sql%E6%B3%A8%E5%85%A5%E8%AF%A5%E6%80%8E%E4%B9%88%E9%98%B2/"/>
      <summary type="text">“林不到你sql发紫可能是预编译没写好” “你防不过我你信吗？” 标题的问题来自学长总结的一道高频面试问题 当时看到的时候，觉得还是挺简单的，因为Order by 和In后面跟…</summary>
      <content type="html"><![CDATA[<p><strong>“林不到你sql发紫可能是预编译没写好”</strong></p>
<p><strong>“你防不过我你信吗？”</strong></p>
<p>标题的问题来自学长总结的一道高频面试问题</p>
<p>当时看到的时候，觉得还是挺简单的，因为<code>Order by </code>和<code>In</code>后面跟的东西本质就不一样</p>
<p>但是为了做到尽量满分不漏回答，在读了一些文章配合ai深入学习之后记录一下</p>
<p>依旧要想知道怎么防御就要知道其漏洞原理</p>
<section><h2>In处<a href="#in处"><span>#</span></a></h2><p>这里我想先说说<code>In</code>，因为<code>in</code>和<code>where id=</code>是有异曲同工之妙的，本质都是“值位”的参数绑定场景</p><p><code>where id=</code>是经典的sql注入点</p><p>预编译正是为了防御此类sql注入</p><p>在代码中这样体现</p><div><figure><figcaption></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>String</span><span> sql </span><span><span>=</span><span> </span></span><span>"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id = ?"</span><span>;</span></div></div><div><div><div>2</div></div><div><span>PreparedStatement</span><span> ps </span><span><span>=</span><span> </span></span><span>conn</span><span>.</span><span>prepareStatement</span><span>(sql);</span></div></div><div><div><div>3</div></div><div><span>ps</span><span>.</span><span>setInt</span><span>(</span><span>1</span><span>, </span><span>123</span><span>);</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><p>这其中，数据库做了两件事</p><ul>
<li>
<p>首先编译Sql模板，确定查询的语法骨架结构</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>将参数123作为纯数据传入sql结构，使得参数值不会再被当作sql代码重新解析</p>
</li>
</ul><p>预编译的详细基础知识可以移步他处学习，这里不过多展开</p><p>这个机制放到 <code>IN</code> 上也是一样的，只是 <code>IN</code> 是可变长度的参数列表</p><p>我们可以看看简单的局部代码</p><div><figure><figcaption></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>List</span><span>&lt;</span><span>Integer</span><span><span>&gt;</span><span> ids </span></span><span><span>=</span><span> </span></span><span>Arrays</span><span>.</span><span>asList</span><span>(</span><span>1</span><span>, </span><span>2</span><span>, </span><span>3</span><span>);</span></div></div><div><div><div>2</div></div><div><span>String</span><span> sql </span><span><span>=</span><span> </span></span><span>"SELECT * FROM users WHERE id IN (?, ?, ?)"</span><span>;</span></div></div><div><div><div>3</div></div><div><span>PreparedStatement</span><span> ps </span><span><span>=</span><span> </span></span><span>conn</span><span>.</span><span>prepareStatement</span><span>(sql);</span></div></div><div><div><div>4</div></div><div><span>ps</span><span>.</span><span>setInt</span><span>(</span><span>1</span><span>, </span><span>ids</span><span>.</span><span>get</span><span>(</span><span>0</span><span>));</span></div></div><div><div><div>5</div></div><div><span>ps</span><span>.</span><span>setInt</span><span>(</span><span>2</span><span>, </span><span>ids</span><span>.</span><span>get</span><span>(</span><span>1</span><span>));</span></div></div><div><div><div>6</div></div><div><span>ps</span><span>.</span><span>setInt</span><span>(</span><span>3</span><span>, </span><span>ids</span><span>.</span><span>get</span><span>(</span><span>2</span><span>));</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><p>很显然，通过预编译，语法结构被锁死，in后的三个<code>?</code>里面待传的也只是数据罢了</p><p>这就是预编译的特点：<strong>结构先定型，数据后填充，数据无法反向污染结构</strong></p><p>所以<code>In</code>处的防御核心其实也是实现参数化查询/预编译</p></section>
<section><h2>Order by处<a href="#order-by处"><span>#</span></a></h2><p>本文的饺子醋就是<code>order by</code></p><p>预编译中，值value是可以用占位符去替代的，但是标识符不能用占位符代替</p><p>比如字符串<code>admin</code>，数字<code>123</code>这些是数据本身，而标识符是数据库对象的名字，比如表名<code>users</code>列名<code>id</code>等</p><p>这些位置是SQL查询结构的一部分，若将这些位置交给用户控制输入则控制的是查询语义而不再是数据值</p><p><code>order by</code>的查询后面跟的只能是以下几种</p><ul>
<li>标识符</li>
<li>位置序号</li>
<li>函数调用</li>
<li>CASE表达式</li>
</ul><p>第三四点合为任意可排序表达式</p><section><h3>Order by注入<a href="#order-by注入"><span>#</span></a></h3><section><h4>确认存在&amp;怎么确定是order by<a href="#确认存在怎么确定是order-by"><span>#</span></a></h4><p>有些时候黑盒光看参数特征无法知道参数所在的具体sql语法结构，并且大多数时候报错也不会回显</p></section><section><h4><strong>ASC/DESC</strong>测试<a href="#ascdesc测试"><span>#</span></a></h4><p>这是<code>order by</code>的语法特性，只在<code>order by</code>的语境下有意义，可以用这个作探测</p><div><figure><figcaption></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span><span>sort</span><span>=</span><span>price </span></span><span>ASC</span></div></div><div><div><div>2</div></div><div><span><span>sort</span><span>=</span><span>price </span></span><span>DESC</span><span>  → 如果数据顺序反转数据量不变，则可能是 </span><span>ORDER BY</span><span> 注入</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><p>而在where的语法结构中，DESC没有意义也不影响结果</p><p><strong>Order by独特的数字语义</strong></p><p><code>order by</code>后面直接跟数字，其结果集的排序随之改变，其数据量不变</p><p>比如<code>sort=1</code>按id排列，<code>sort=2</code>按Name排列，<code>sort=3</code>按Price排列</p><p>并且在数值超出列的最大值时有可能会报错</p><div><figure><figcaption></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>Unknown column </span><span>'10086'</span><span> </span><span>in</span><span> </span><span>'order clause'</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><p>而在<code>where id=</code>的结构中，id后面的数字影响的是数据的完全变化</p></section><section><h4>盲注里面的体现<a href="#盲注里面的体现"><span>#</span></a></h4><p>基础结构</p><div><figure><figcaption></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>ORDER BY</span><span> (</span><span>CASE</span><span> </span><span>WHEN</span><span><span> </span><span>[布尔条件]</span><span> </span></span><span>THEN</span><span><span> </span><span>[列A]</span><span> </span></span><span>ELSE</span><span><span> </span><span>[列B]</span><span> </span></span><span>END</span><span>)</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><p>很好读懂，条件为真就按列A排序，条件为假就按列B排列</p><p>正是因为这一点，开发者不得不拼接这些部分</p><div><figure><figcaption></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>SELECT</span><span> * </span><span>FROM</span><span> users </span><span>ORDER BY</span><span> ?</span></div></div><div><div><div>2</div></div><div><span>-- 绑定参数 "name"</span></div></div><div><div><div>3</div></div><div><span>-- 数据库理解为: ORDER BY 'name'  （把name当成字符串值）</span></div></div><div><div><div>4</div></div><div><span>-- 不是:        ORDER BY name     （按name列排序）</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><p>在代码中的体现</p><div><figure><figcaption></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>String</span><span> sort </span><span><span>=</span><span> </span></span><span>request</span><span>.</span><span>getParameter</span><span>(</span><span>"sort"</span><span><span>);</span><span>   </span></span><span>// 用户可控</span></div></div><div><div><div>2</div></div><div><span>String</span><span> order </span><span><span>=</span><span> </span></span><span>request</span><span>.</span><span>getParameter</span><span>(</span><span>"order"</span><span><span>);</span><span> </span></span><span>// 用户可控</span></div></div><div><div><div>3</div></div><div><span>String</span><span> sql </span><span><span>=</span><span> </span></span><span>"SELECT * FROM products ORDER BY "</span><span><span> </span><span>+</span><span> sort </span><span>+</span><span> </span></span><span>" "</span><span><span> </span><span>+</span><span> order</span><span>;</span></span></div></div><div><div><div>4</div></div><div><span>PreparedStatement</span><span> pstmt </span><span><span>=</span><span> </span></span><span>conn</span><span>.</span><span>prepareStatement</span><span>(sql);</span></div></div><div><div><div>5</div></div><div><span>// 预编译在这里完全没有意义，因为注入点在SQL骨架里，不在参数里</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><p>而上面我们知道，<code>order by</code>后面也是可以跟数字的，在跟数字的时候为什么不能用预编译防不了呢？</p><p>原因是<code>order by</code>和<code>where id=</code>后面跟的数字身份不一样</p><p>在where结构中，id后面的数字是一个值节点，一个<strong>用来比较的数据</strong></p><p>而在order by中，后面的数字是一个<strong>排序项序号引用</strong>，本质还是去找数值对应的列</p><p>这样又回到了最开始的问题，预编译的只能是数据而不能是数据库本身的对象</p><p>其实允许用户输入直接作为列名和表名本身就是开发设计上的缺陷，但有很多不得不保留而不考虑完全重写的情况</p><p>最好的方案就是进行白名单映射</p></section><section><h4>白名单映射<a href="#白名单映射"><span>#</span></a></h4><p>旨在永远不让用户输入的直接进入sql</p><p>白名单映射，用户输入的必须在映射表里面，如果不在就会返回默认值</p><p>比如一个例子</p><div><div><div><figure><figcaption></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>import</span><span> </span><span>java.sql.Connection</span><span>;</span></div></div><div><div><div>2</div></div><div><span>import</span><span> </span><span>java.sql.PreparedStatement</span><span>;</span></div></div><div><div><div>3</div></div><div><span>import</span><span> </span><span>java.sql.ResultSet</span><span>;</span></div></div><div><div><div>4</div></div><div><span>import</span><span> </span><span>java.util.Map</span><span>;</span></div></div><div><div><div>5</div></div><div>
</div></div><div><div><div>6</div></div><div><span>public</span><span> </span><span>class</span><span><span> </span><span>ProductQueryService</span><span> </span></span><span>{</span></div></div><div><div><div>7</div></div><div><span>    </span><span>// 允许排序的字段白名单：key 是前端参数，value 是后端固定列名</span></div></div><div><div><div>8</div></div><div><span>    </span><span>private</span><span> </span><span>static</span><span> </span><span>final</span><span> </span><span>Map</span><span>&lt;</span><span>String</span><span><span>,</span><span> </span></span><span>String</span><span><span>&gt;</span><span> SORT_FIELD_MAP </span></span><span><span>=</span><span> </span></span><span>Map</span><span>.</span><span>of</span><span>(</span></div></div><div><div><div>9</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>"id"</span><span>, </span><span>"id"</span><span>,</span></div></div><div><div><div>10</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>"name"</span><span>, </span><span>"name"</span><span>,</span></div></div><div><div><div>11</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>"price"</span><span>, </span><span>"price"</span><span>,</span></div></div><div><div><div>12</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>"createdAt"</span><span>, </span><span>"created_at"</span></div></div><div><div><div>13</div></div><div><span><span>    </span></span><span>);</span></div></div><div><div><div>14</div></div><div>
</div></div><div><div><div>15</div></div><div><span>    </span><span>public</span><span> </span><span>ResultSet</span><span> </span><span>queryProducts</span><span>(</span><span>Connection</span><span><span> </span><span>conn</span><span>, </span></span><span>String</span><span><span> </span><span>sortField</span><span>, </span></span><span>String</span><span><span> </span><span>sortOrder</span><span>)</span><span> </span></span><span>throws</span><span> </span><span>Exception</span><span><span> </span><span>{</span></span></div></div><div><div><div>16</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>// 1. 白名单映射字段：用户输入不直接进 SQL</span></div></div><div><div><div>17</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>String</span><span><span> </span><span>safeColumn</span><span> </span></span><span><span>=</span><span> </span></span><span>SORT_FIELD_MAP</span><span>.</span><span>get</span><span>(sortField);</span></div></div><div><div><div>18</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>if</span><span><span> (safeColumn </span><span>==</span><span> </span></span><span>null</span><span>) {</span></div></div><div><div><div>19</div></div><div><span>            </span><span>// 非法字段直接拒绝，也可以改成默认字段</span></div></div><div><div><div>20</div></div><div><span>            </span><span>throw</span><span> </span><span>new</span><span> </span><span>IllegalArgumentException</span><span>(</span><span>"invalid sort field"</span><span>);</span></div></div><div><div><div>21</div></div><div><span><span>        </span></span><span>}</span></div></div><div><div><div>22</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>// 2. 排序方向只允许固定枚举</span></div></div><div><div><div>23</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>String</span><span><span> </span><span>safeOrder</span><span> </span></span><span><span>=</span><span> </span></span><span>"DESC"</span><span>.</span><span>equalsIgnoreCase</span><span>(sortOrder) </span><span>?</span><span> </span><span>"DESC"</span><span> </span><span>:</span><span> </span><span>"ASC"</span><span>;</span></div></div><div><div><div>24</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>// 3. 最终进入 SQL 的是服务端选出来的常量，不是用户原始输入</span></div></div><div><div><div>25</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>String</span><span><span> </span><span>sql</span><span> </span></span><span><span>=</span><span> </span></span><span>"SELECT id, name, price, created_at FROM products ORDER BY "</span><span><span> </span><span>+</span><span> safeColumn </span><span>+</span><span> </span></span><span>" "</span><span><span> </span><span>+</span><span> safeOrder;</span></span></div></div><div><div><div>26</div></div><div>
</div></div><div><div><div>27</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>PreparedStatement</span><span><span> </span><span>ps</span><span> </span></span><span><span>=</span><span> </span></span><span>conn</span><span>.</span><span>prepareStatement</span><span>(sql);</span></div></div><div><div><div>28</div></div><div><span>        </span><span>return</span><span> </span><span>ps</span><span>.</span><span>executeQuery</span><span>();</span></div></div><div><div><div>29</div></div><div><span><span>    </span></span><span>}</span></div></div><div><div><div>30</div></div><div><span>}</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure><div></div></div><span>展开</span><span>收起</span></div></div><p>而如果是表达式排序是一样的，比如想按 <code>CASE</code> 或 <code>COALESCE</code> 排序，白名单不一定只能映射到裸列名，也可以映射到后端预定义的安全表达式，只要表达式本身是写死的就行，比如：</p><div><figure><figcaption></figcaption><pre><code><div><div><div>1</div></div><div><span>private</span><span> </span><span>static</span><span> </span><span>final</span><span> </span><span>Map</span><span>&lt;</span><span>String</span><span><span>,</span><span> </span></span><span>String</span><span><span>&gt;</span><span> SORT_FIELD_MAP </span></span><span><span>=</span><span> </span></span><span>Map</span><span>.</span><span>of</span><span>(</span></div></div><div><div><div>2</div></div><div><span>    </span><span>"name"</span><span>, </span><span>"name"</span><span>,</span></div></div><div><div><div>3</div></div><div><span>    </span><span>"price"</span><span>, </span><span>"price"</span><span>,</span></div></div><div><div><div>4</div></div><div><span>    </span><span>"displayName"</span><span>, </span><span>"COALESCE(nickname, name)"</span><span>,</span></div></div><div><div><div>5</div></div><div><span>    </span><span>"statusWeight"</span><span>, </span><span>"CASE WHEN status = 'VIP' THEN 1 ELSE 2 END"</span></div></div><div><div><div>6</div></div><div><span>);</span></div></div></code></pre><div><div></div><div></div></div></figure></div><blockquote><p>辅助措施:<strong>改变数据传入方式</strong></p><p>还把允许用户自由控制输入的排序字段变成前端提供排列选择的选项</p><p>这个挺好理解的，其实和白名单很像，只是前端负责了这个过程</p></blockquote></section><section><h4>最小权限/权限分级原则<a href="#最小权限权限分级原则"><span>#</span></a></h4><p>在数据库层面划分权限，普通业务账号设置只读或者限制功能，这样顶多是数据泄露而不是删库（drop权限）等改的操作</p></section></section></section>
<section><h2>总结<a href="#总结"><span>#</span></a></h2><p>参数化查询主要保护的是数据值上下文。像列名、表名、排序方向、表达式片段、SQL 关键字等结构性内容，通常不能直接靠占位符安全替代。一旦让用户输入直接决定这些结构元素，就需要白名单映射或重构查询逻辑</p></section>]]></content>
    </entry>
